{"speciesId":408,"names":{"fr":"Kranidos","es":"Cranidos","en":"Cranidos","ja":"ズガイドス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It lived in jungles around 100 million years ago. Its skull is as hard as iron."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It was resurrected from an iron ball-like fossil. It downs prey with its head butts."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"A lifelong jungle dweller from 100 million years ago, it would snap obstructing trees with head butts."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"CRANIDOS toughen up their already rock-hard heads by headbutting one another."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"CRANIDOS toughen up their already rock-hard heads by headbutting one another."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il vivait dans la jungle il y a 100 millions d’années. Il abat un arbre d’un coup de tête."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"A lifelong jungle dweller from 100 million years ago, it would snap obstructing trees with head butts."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il vivait dans la jungle il y a 100 millions d’années. Il abat un arbre d’un coup de tête."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"A lifelong jungle dweller from 100 million years ago, it would snap obstructing trees with head butts."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"A lifelong jungle dweller from 100 million years ago, it would snap obstructing trees with head butts."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"A lifelong jungle dweller from 100 million years ago, it would snap obstructing trees with head butts."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"On l’a ressuscité à partir d’un fossile de fer en forme de balle. Il abat ses proies à coups de tête."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Fue recreado a partir de un fósil con forma esférica. Derriba a las presas a cabezazos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It was resurrected from an iron ball-like fossil. It downs prey with its headbutts."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"鉄球の ような 化石から 復活した 古代の ポケモン。 頭突きで 獲物を しとめた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il vivait dans la jungle il y a 100 millions d’années. Il peut abattre un arbre d’un coup de tête."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Vivía en la jungla hace 100 millones de años. Apartaba los árboles del camino a cabezazos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"A lifelong jungle dweller from 100 million years ago, it would snap obstructing trees with headbutts."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"およそ １億年前の ポケモン。 ジャングルで 生まれ育ち 邪魔な 樹木は 頭突きで へしおった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"On l’a ressuscité à partir d’un fossile de fer en forme de balle. Il abat ses proies à coups de tête."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Fue recreado a partir de un fósil con forma esférica. Derriba a las presas a cabezazos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It was resurrected from an iron ball-like fossil. It downs prey with its headbutts."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"鉄球の ような 化石から 復活した 古代の ポケモン。 頭突きで 獲物を しとめた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il vivait dans la jungle il y a 100 millions d’années. Il peut abattre un arbre d’un coup de tête."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Vivía en la jungla hace 100 millones de años. Apartaba los árboles del camino a cabezazos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"A lifelong jungle dweller from 100 million years ago, it would snap obstructing trees with headbutts."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"およそ １億年前の ポケモン。 ジャングルで 生まれ育ち 邪魔な 樹木は 頭突きで へしおった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il peuplait les jungles il y a 100 millions d’années et se débarrassait de son grand rival, Ptéra, en lui donnant des coups de tête."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Vivía en la jungla hace 100 millones de años. Gracias a su destreza propinando cabezazos podía hacerle frente a Aerodactyl."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It lived in jungles around a hundred million years ago. It used its skillful headbutts to combat Aerodactyl."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"１億年ほど 前の 密林で 暮らしていた。 得意の 頭突きで プテラに 対抗 していた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Auprès des fossiles de Kranidos, il n’est pas rare de trouver des arbres pétrifiés complètement broyés."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"En los estratos geológicos donde se encuentran fósiles de Cranidos también aparecen muchos fósiles de árboles destrozados."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"In rock layers where Cranidos fossils are found, the fossilized trunks of trees snapped in two are also often found."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"ズガイドスの 化石が 見つかる 地層では へし折れた 樹木の 化石も 一緒に 出てくるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Un Pokémon préhistorique doté d’un crâne très solide, mais d’un cerveau très peu performant."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Este Pokémon arcaico cuenta con un cráneo sólido y resistente, pero su cerebro no está a la par."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"A primeval Pokémon, it possesses a hard and sturdy skull, lacking any intelligence within."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"太古の ポケモン。 硬くて 丈夫な 頭蓋骨を 持つが 頭は 相当に 悪かった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Son crâne extrêmement solide est sa principale caractéristique. Il s’en servait pour faire tomber des arbres les Baies dont il se nourrissait."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Se caracteriza por la dureza de su cráneo. Derribaba árboles a cabezazos para comerse las bayas maduras que colgaban de ellos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its hard skull is its distinguishing feature. It snapped trees by headbutting them, and then it fed on their ripe berries."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"硬い 頭蓋骨が 特徴。 頭突きで 樹木を へし折って 実った きのみを 食っていた。"},{"la